      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسُومٌ</span></b>  One <i>who toils,</i> or <i>works laboriously,</i> or
<i>who seeks gain</i> or <i>the means of subsistence, for his
family,</i> or <i>household;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاسِمٌ</span></b> : pl. [of the
former, and perhaps of the latter also,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُسُمٌ</span>. (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And A she-camel <i>that has many young
ones.</i> (K.)

